      },
      "text": "with which row in Y. Instead, we leverage the Wasserstein distance in (1.2) to infer",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.20698052449943194,
        "y0": 0.5691846416454123,
        "x1": 0.7015291974435445,
        "y1": 0.5817636817392677
      },
      "text": "these correspondences. Our next example fits this setup more closely.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.20698052449943194,
        "y0": 0.5993753117744369,
        "x1": 0.614831849640491,
        "y1": 0.6119543518682923
      },
      "text": "Example 2 (Point-cloud registration or scan matching).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6235735525492749,
        "y0": 0.5993753117744369,
        "x1": 0.7924982706705729,
        "y1": 0.6119543518682923
      },
      "text": "Point-cloud registration",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.6144699917899238,
        "x1": 0.7924949546265446,
        "y1": 0.6270490318837791
      },
      "text": "is an important problem for aligning 2D/3D shapes with applications in shape anal-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.6295646718054106,
        "x1": 0.671511207530701,
        "y1": 0.6421437118992661
      },
      "text": "ysis, computer vision, robotics, and medical imaging [5, 36, 17].",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6823854134752859,
        "y0": 0.6295646718054106,
        "x1": 0.7924786237330218,
        "y1": 0.6421437118992661
      },
      "text": "The problem is",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.6446593518208976,
        "x1": 0.7924135744182113,
        "y1": 0.657238391914753
      },
      "text": "to find the optimal spatial transformation (scaling, rotation and translation) that",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.6597540318363845,
        "x1": 0.5879522585401348,
        "y1": 0.6723330719302398
      },
      "text": "minimizes the discrepancy between two point clouds.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5971497679068372,
        "y0": 0.6597540318363845,
        "x1": 0.7924297058504391,
        "y1": 0.6723330719302398
      },
      "text": "The Iterative Closest Point",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.6748499834176266,
        "x1": 0.6786248948838975,
        "y1": 0.6874290235114819
      },
      "text": "or ICP algorithm is a widely used method to solve this problem.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6892386043772978,
        "y0": 0.6748499834176266,
        "x1": 0.7925110361934488,
        "y1": 0.6874290235114819
      },
      "text": "The algorithm",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.6899446826992612,
        "x1": 0.46581283270143997,
        "y1": 0.7025237227931167
      },
      "text": "iteratively refines the alignment by:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4759219300513174,
        "y0": 0.6899446826992612,
        "x1": 0.7924134996202257,
        "y1": 0.7025237227931167
      },
      "text": "(1) finding correspondences by pairing each",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.705039381980896,
        "x1": 0.79247859880036,
        "y1": 0.7176184220747515
      },
      "text": "point in one data set with its “nearest” point (either in a greedy or an optimal",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.7201340812625308,
        "x1": 0.792429730783101,
        "y1": 0.7327131213563861
      },
      "text": "matching sense) in the other, (2) estimating a transformation that minimizes the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.7352287805441654,
        "x1": 0.7924623427048229,
        "y1": 0.7478078206380208
      },
      "text": "sum of squared distances between the matched points, and (3) applying the trans-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.7503234798258,
        "x1": 0.7924460866092856,
        "y1": 0.7629025199196555
      },
      "text": "formation and repeating until convergence. Despite its efficiency, ICP suffers from",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.7654194314070422,
        "x1": 0.7923319947485831,
        "y1": 0.7779984715008976
      },
      "text": "sensitivity to initialization, often converging to local minima if the initial alignment",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.7805141306886769,
        "x1": 0.2610585580464282,
        "y1": 0.7930931707825324
      },
      "text": "is poor.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.27023978638493157,
        "y0": 0.7805141306886769,
        "x1": 0.6329793493732129,
        "y1": 0.7930931707825324
      },
      "text": "Additionally, it is vulnerable to noise and outliers.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6421605527790544,
        "y0": 0.7805141306886769,
        "x1": 0.7923972933900123,
        "y1": 0.7930931707825324
      },
      "text": "Many variants of the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.206980512033101,
        "y0": 0.7956088299703117,
        "x1": 0.7924624424354703,
        "y1": 0.808187870064167
      },
      "text": "ICP algorithm have been developed over the years to improve its accuracy, robust-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
